Third-party notices
====================

This project (MTG-AI) does not redistribute any third-party source code in
its own repository. It does, at runtime and via an offline ingestion script,
read and index a third party's open-source card implementations from a local
checkout for use as reference context handed to a locally-run LLM — see
mtg-commander-engine-spec.md's "Phase 3a" for the design, and
scripts/ingest-xmage-cards.mjs for the ingestion itself.

XMage (magefree/mage)
----------------------

Project:  XMage — https://github.com/magefree/mage
Used for: scripts/ingest-xmage-cards.mjs sparse-checks out
          Mage.Sets/src/mage/cards from the project above into a local,
          gitignored directory (data/xmage-source), and indexes each card's
          Java implementation into a local SQLite table (src/lib/cardDb.ts's
          xmage_cards). src/lib/xmageGrounding.ts and its two callers
          (src/lib/cardParser.ts, src/lib/primitiveActionPlan.ts) look up a
          card's XMage implementation and, when the plain oracle text alone
          isn't enough, include it as read-only reference context in a
          request to a locally-run LLM — never redistributed, published, or
          shipped as part of this project's own source or build output.

